abstract: >
  Lean 4 formalization of Structural Explainability integration.
  This repository composes the neutral structural substrate and
  identity regimes into cross-cutting theorems, traceability
  relationships, and system-level structural invariants.
  It does not define substrate primitives, identity regimes,
  persistence behavior, domain semantics, or operational validation.

keywords:
  - structural-explainability
  - integration
  - traceability
  - lean4
  - theorem-proving
  - formal-verification
  - composition
  - invariants
  - proof-carrying

